
# Google Sheets

## About
Google Sheets is an online spreadsheet application developed by Google. It allows users to organize, manage, analyze, and share data efficiently.

## Skills Learned
- Creating and editing spreadsheets
- Organizing data using rows and columns
- Using basic formulas and functions
- Formatting cells and tables
- Creating charts and graphs
- Sorting and filtering data
- Collaborating and sharing spreadsheets
- Using Google Sheets for school activities and projects

## Tools Used
- Google Sheets
- Google Drive
- Google Workspace

## Purpose
To develop basic spreadsheet management, data organization, and collaboration skills that can be useful in academic activities and future professional work.

## Conclusion
Learning Google Sheets helped me improve my ability to organize information, perform basic calculations, and manage data efficiently.
